  "ingredients": [
    "2 large red bell peppers",
    "3 tablespoons extra virgin olive oil",
    "2 tablespoons minced garlic",
    "0.25 cup fresh basil",
    "2 cups half-and-half",
    "0.25 cup grated Romano cheese",
    "4 tablespoons butter",
    "salt and pepper to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/LmX7AVJEVtRyndGI_pwYW4sm7n8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/29112-Roasted-Red-Pepper-Sauce-DDMFS-step-01-2e0d542581bf4061bfcd22d4c2f5e831.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/29112/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the broiler. Lightly coat the red peppers with olive oil. Cook peppers under the broiler until the skin is blackened, and the flesh has softened slightly. Place peppers in a paper bag or resealable plastic bag to cool for approximately 45 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/XYrpe2-06_4dSgG1g_WlGDJHbpY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/29112-Roasted-Red-Pepper-Sauce-DDMFS-step-02-3e80236da5b04c7dbf645ba3557d7116.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/29112/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove the seeds and skin from the peppers (the skin should come off the peppers easily now). Cut peppers into small pieces.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/U33nK4OLdWftvXjBA0eU8ZUNt40=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/29112-Roasted-Red-Pepper-Sauce-DDMFS-step-03-9b7943e6516344099c5102995a86e03b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/29112/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat oil in a large skillet over medium-low heat. Add chopped red peppers, garlic, and basil; cook and stir until flavors combine, about 5 to 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/23G6_XQhZ1m_30-tbWTHKVOwJwQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/29112-Roasted-Red-Pepper-Sauce-DDMFS-step-04-d766e535be274670b893af6a5396c231.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/29112/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Carefully place mixture into a blender and puree to desired consistency. Return puree to the skillet, and reheat to a boil.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/duTuc4XhSSZIlqLTaBVDA99lRtQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/29112-Roasted-Red-Pepper-Sauce-DDMFS-step-05-4871cb0005eb4c8791ccf4655e76dff7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/29112/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in half-and-half and Romano cheese; cook and stir until cheese melts. Add butter, and stir until melted.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/2t9RhZxROzulFUmivoTByzhWI2k=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/29112-Roasted-Red-Pepper-Sauce-DDMFS-step-06-a339b24e12384890abfe6d0f92a25429.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/29112/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Season with salt and pepper to taste. Simmer for 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/YKgWESw8qhijXRZqbDUbB3YjxGY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/29112-Roasted-Red-Pepper-Sauce-DDMFS-step-07-895b7523089948129e99b0af340fcf4c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/29112/step_07.webp"
    }
